<title>USA: Norex Industries Inc Q4 net profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Norex Industries Inc Q4 net profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995 (A)</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $1.78     loss	 $1.42</p>
<p> Net profit		 8,687     loss	 8,938</p>
<p> Revs			 3,543		    3,352</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   4,881		    6,296</p>
<p>	  Year</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $3.35     loss	 $0.97</p>
<p> Net profit		19,663     loss	 5,990</p>
<p> Revs			 5,953		   10,587</p>
<p> Avg shrs		   5,871		    6,206</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE (A): In 1995 the company changed its fiscal year-end from June 30 to December 31. Therefore, the amounts reflected for the year 1995 include the last two fiscal quarters for the fiscal year ending June 30, 1995 and the two quarters for the six month transition period ending December 31, 1995.</p>
